        <p><strong>Best For:</strong> Frequent drops on heavy fabric with low per-color minimums</p>

        <h3>4. Performance Fabric Manufacturer (Zhejiang)</h3>

        <p>Zhejiang's textile belt feeds technical knits to sportswear brands worldwide. Local factories specialize in polyester-spandex blends, brushed-back interlock, and fabrics carrying wicking or UV treatments, which makes them the natural home for training joggers. Flatlock and bonded seams are routine, and color consistency across repeat orders tends to be stronger than at cut-and-sew-only shops</p>

